    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "な、なになになに？\r\nなんか謝ってもらうようなことあったっけ……？！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……この間の",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うん……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "オーディションの結果を聞いた日のことだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うん……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華の『大丈夫だ』っていう気持ちを\r\n無視しそうになったこと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そういう、結華を見くびるような\r\n失礼な態度をとってしまったこと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "謝らなきゃと思ったんだ\r\n──本当に、申し訳ない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……いやいやいや",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサー、気にしすぎ\r\n三峰、それもう済んだことだと思ってたよ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……でも……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でもじゃない\r\n──だってさぁ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰が『それはやめて』って言って、\r\nプロデューサーは『あ、俺間違ってた』って納得してくれて",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ちゃんとお互いにわかり合って、\r\nあの日は別れたわけでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……ああ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "じゃあ、それで解決じゃない？\r\n変に引きずらなくていいんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "正しい手順踏んでるじゃん\r\n──……それに",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰は、嬉しかったんだから",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『今の、嫌だよ』って、ちゃんと言えてさ\r\nプロデューサーにもそれを、わかってもらえて",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701003/2007010030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010030170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "何かあったら──……",
